            "notes": "For the early round, i'm using this build to farm money : https://stadiumbuilds.io/build/d81468c8-699a-4fe1-83f6-fb4cbbc47475 \n\nWe take  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) as the item is really good for how cheap he is, we then fill with  [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) to be more lethal with the blizzard and your right click.  [Snowball Flight](item_770c6b61-98a8-489f-b44e-c1cc65c0cd7d) gets you another wall with blizzard to be more annoying, it can also save you when you are getting out of your ice block\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nWith s18, I started running more [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed), my sweet spot is 25% [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed), i've changed the items for the next rounds, but you can still use Ice Palace to farm cash.",
