            "notes": "Now that you are on round 5, we do a 180 on the build and start building only toward tankyness to become a nuissance on point to the enemy team.  We take [Blizznado](item_208ab663-2529-489a-87d9-d798d94f4c22) to heal ourself and start requiring less help from supports to stay alive, try and put your wall in a way to block enemy's and that you can stand in it.\n\nIf you run into an admin lobby, i'd suggest trying to tank for your team, I could see [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) taken instead early instead of [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) for it.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nRight now, [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is bugged so it's a must pick.",
